## Title: Lazy Confirm (Patch)
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 100
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: Removes the 2 second wait on "are you sure" prompts (destroy item, ready check, locked item) without touching the game's dialog code. A rewrite of Dolgubon's Lazy Confirm, whose hook on the dialog function leaves prompt buttons unable to withdraw, deposit or accept. Use one or the other, not both.
## DevId: a2a9a715-4e28-49e9-9b50-446b33917287

